        "created_at": "2019-02-19T05:26:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Anubis\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/anubis/48/4949_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Anubis:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>What about the somewhat conflicting start of Tome of The Bizarre? She says go to desert and we’re in Las Vegas…&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Who is the “she” you are talking about? The author? Your GM? Because actually reading it I don’t see anything remotely like what you are saying.</p>",
