        "id": 214289,
        "name": "PlatinumWarlock",
        "username": "PlatinumWarlock",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-02-19T13:48:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The whole point of the adventure is that it's a bait-and-switch.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>You're meant to think that you're in an Egyptian tomb, and only find out that you're actually in a replica at the end of the adventure.</p>",
