        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/under3/{size}/1872_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-08-08T11:11:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was recently looking over the starter set and the in the final issue one of the villain's abilities says to attack using Weaponry, but has no power or quality called Weaponry. Have we ever had any clarification on this error or has it even been raised by anyone elsewhere as it's not listed here?</p>",
